sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant BA as Broker A
    participant DB as SQLite broker
    participant I as Inventory
    participant IDB as SQLite Inventory
    participant BB as Broker B

    P->>BA: Publish(messageId=X)
    BA->>DB: commit message + delivery
    BA-->>P: accepted
    I->>BA: Subscribe
    BA-->>I: Delivery X attempt=1
    I->>BA: ACK RECEIVED
    I->>IDB: commit local effect + X as processed
    I->>BA: ACK PROCESSED
    I--xBA: crash/disconnect BEFORE ACK PERSISTED
    BA->>DB: lease expires, schedule retry with backoff
    I->>BB: reconnect + Subscribe
    BB->>DB: claim same X, attempt=2
    BB-->>I: Delivery X attempt=2
    I->>IDB: X already processed -> DEDUP_SKIP
    I->>BB: ACK PERSISTED
    BB->>DB: status=COMPLETED
